'''Galvanic Flare''' is a [[debuff]] from the monster skill of the same name. It deals [[lightning]] [[damage over time]].

It is used by the boss and side-boss of {{il|The Vinktar Square}}: [[Avatar of Thunder]] and [[Guardian of the South]] (in boss room the side boss is known as [[Revived Guardian]]).

Galvanic Flare also used by the storyline optional boss [[Nightbringer Lucius]] in [[The Lunaris Concourse]]. it is also used by its map variant: [[Nebria, the Last Light]] ({{il|The Twilight Temple}})

Galvanic Flare was in fact coded as minion.<ref>[[Monster:Metadata/Monsters/InvisibleFire/InvisibleIonCannonVinktarBoss]]</ref> It is a not targetable, no nameplate monster. It uses a skill internally known as [[Skill:InvisibleIonCannonRighteousLightning|InvisibleIonCannonRighteousLightning]] (or [[Skill:InvisibleIonCannonRighteousLightningAxisBoss|InvisibleIonCannonRighteousLightningAxisBoss]]) which deals actual lightning damage to the player character and their allies.
==Monsters==
The following [[monster]]s (or invisible mechanic that coded as monster) use summon Galvanic Flare skills:
{{#cargo_query:
|tables=monsters
|fields=CONCAT("[[", _pageName, "|", name, "]]")=Monster names, skill_ids
|where=skill_ids HOLDS LIKE "%SummonIonCannon%" 

|limit=100
|order by=name
}}

The following "[[monster]]s" use the actual Galvanic Flare skill, that deals [[lightning]] [[damage over time]]:
{{#cargo_query:
|tables=monsters
|fields=CONCAT("[[", _pageName, "|", name, "]]")=Monster names, metadata_id, skill_ids
|where=skill_ids HOLDS LIKE "InvisibleIonCannonRighteousLightning%" 

|limit=100
|order by=name
}}

